    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p><p><strong>Mark of the Worgen.</strong> Most of the time the sword looks unremarkable, but under the night sky, ragged fur and sharp fangs sprout around its cross guard. While transformed this way, Shadowfang deals an extra 2d6 Necrotic damage on a hit. It returns to normal at dawn or when brought indoors.</p>",
